+| s2 solo | 10 | 8 | 0 | 2 | 9 | 6 (K2, K4, K9, K10, K11, K12) | 7 | none | 120k | 1.30 | 320 s |
+| s1 ∪ s2 | | | | | 15 | 6 | 9 | K15 | 274k | 3.07 | |
