-| `gpt-6-astra` medium, tuned forked fan | `P1` | 9 | 4 | 5 | 0 | 3 of 12 | 0 of 2 | 263k | 414 s |
-| `gpt-6-astra` high, tuned forked fan | `P4` | 10 | 4 | 6 | 0 | 4 of 11 | 2 of 3 | 631k | 950 s |
