-A finding whose fix adds, drops, moves or pairs targets, or changes a verify command, proposes only a fix that every check in the validation-checks section of `/home/knatte/Code/loomyard-LYMHUB/codex-v2-p1-bench/.scratch/bench/inputs/P1/work/.bench/specs/loom/loom-plan-spec.md` admits.
