-- `harness/`: `build.sh`, `build-fan.sh`, `build-forkfan.sh`, `run-forkfan.sh`, `setup-codex-home.sh`, `windows.sh`, `dump.sh` and `evidence.sh`, working on `.scratch/bench/`, which is not committed.
