+A fix to its work is a follow-up card placed after the last begun batch, with its Card Index line in `00-overview.md`, in the format `/home/knatte/Code/loomyard-LYMHUB/codex-astra-fork-fan-bench/.scratch/bench/inputs/P4/work/.bench/specs/loom/loom-plan-spec.md` defines.
+A fix inserts or removes a card only with `lyx loom insert-card` or `lyx loom remove-card`, which renumber the later cards and whose `--help` says what they do, never by renaming, rewriting under a new name or deleting a card file by hand.
