+   Card 10 adds `InnerRun.OwnerCheck`, `PauseOwned`, `ParentHoldsTaskWork` and `Restepped`; card 12 adds `Landing.ParentHoldsTaskWork`, `ParentOwner`, `OriginParentHoldsWork` and `ParentCommitsOriginLacks`.
