-{"systemMessage":"[creel] #1 from ly:orch: write the word PINEAPPLE into reply.txt","hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"PostToolUse","additionalContext":"[creel] #1 from ly:orch: write the word PINEAPPLE into reply.txt"}}
-EOT
