-## Estimated removal
-
-- Fixing items 1 (once per distinct error), 2, 4, 5, 6, 7 removes about 27450 of 30111 level lines, roughly 91% (1: ~25200, 2: ~1100, 4: ~400, 5: ~300, 6: 324, 7: 189, less a few dozen kept).
