+# Card DAG: /home/knatte/Code/loomyard-LYMHUB/psb-wv-plan/_lym/plan
+
+15 cards, 29 direct dependencies, critical path 7 cards, widest level 4 cards.
+
+## Levels
+
+A card's level is the number of cards on the longest chain ending at it; cards of one level have no path between them.
+
+| Level | Cards |
+|---|---|
+| 1 | 1-bolt-dir-name, 5-bolt-dir-stencils, 6-entrymerge |
+| 2 | 2-bolt-dir-fabric-sweep, 3-bolt-dir-callers-sweep, 4-bolt-dir-test-sweep, 8-heddle-store |
+| 3 | 7-bolt-replayer-registry, 9-heddle-render, 14-prompt-passages |
+| 4 | 10-warp-exclude, 12-heddle-replayer |
+| 5 | 11-warp-seam |
+| 6 | 13-heddle-warp-seam |
+| 7 | 15-heddle-cli |
+
+## Dependencies
+
+Each card's direct dependencies, `C` where both cards change an overlapping ref, `U` where one only uses it.
+An `E` cell is a card that only adds to the ref: two of them on one ref make no dependency unless both cards fence a line for one PATTERN entry ID, and an `E` against a `C` counts as `C`.
+
+| Card | After |
+|---|---|
+| 1-bolt-dir-name |  |
+| 2-bolt-dir-fabric-sweep | 1-bolt-dir-name (C) |
+| 3-bolt-dir-callers-sweep | 1-bolt-dir-name (U) |
+| 4-bolt-dir-test-sweep | 1-bolt-dir-name (U) |
+| 5-bolt-dir-stencils |  |
+| 6-entrymerge |  |
+| 7-bolt-replayer-registry | 2-bolt-dir-fabric-sweep (C), 3-bolt-dir-callers-sweep (C), 6-entrymerge (C) |
+| 8-heddle-store | 1-bolt-dir-name (C) |
+| 9-heddle-render | 1-bolt-dir-name (C), 8-heddle-store (C) |
+| 10-warp-exclude | 2-bolt-dir-fabric-sweep (C), 7-bolt-replayer-registry (C) |
+| 11-warp-seam | 2-bolt-dir-fabric-sweep (C), 3-bolt-dir-callers-sweep (U), 7-bolt-replayer-registry (C), 10-warp-exclude (U) |
+| 12-heddle-replayer | 6-entrymerge (U), 7-bolt-replayer-registry (C), 8-heddle-store (U) |
