-| machine-handover | 10-22 05:52 | B | 22.96 | 11.43 | 34.39 | 9 | 28.3 | 3 | 53.37 | 1h07m |
-| darn-verify-fixes | 10-22 05:52 | B | 7.24 | 5.45 | 12.69 | 9 | 22.0 | 1 | 17.81 | 30m |
