-| batten-cancel-verb | 10-22 17:22 | C | 8.17 | 7.15 | 15.32 | 6 | 26.4 | 1 | 24.03 | no timing row |
-| plan-card-rules | 10-22 17:22 | C | 11.59 | 9.09 | 20.68 | 6 | 25.4 | 1 | 26.86 | no timing row |
