-## Bench base
-
-Write the decision record as if the code were at base 800a0e892: read that base with `git show 800a0e892:<path>` (and `git grep ... 800a0e892`) and treat 1e79825ff and everything after it as not landed. This pair is a bench run, and its output is graded against a reference discussion written on 800a0e892, so the record must face the same code. Do not repair the pair.
