-| ir | 17:52:04–19 | 17:53:40 | 17:53:42 | 0 of 11 | yes |
-| wr | 17:59:10–28 | 18:02:16 | 18:02:19 | 0 of 9 | yes |
-| pr | 17:52:36–51 | 17:53:59 | 17:54:01 | 0 of 7 | yes |
