+## Per factor
+
+| Factor | Level | Cost/plan | Real | Real M+ | Distinct real | Wrong dispositions | Key R / P |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| timing | after (A+B) | $8.13 | 47 | 7 | 44 | 2 | 7 / 4 |
